{"title":"","icon":"","img":"","tags":"","hideInMenu":"false","text":"module","cls":"Wb.Module","properties":{"cid":"module","remark":"Select config items","serverScript":"function main(){let e=[],t=Params.path+\".\",n=t.length,a,s,i,b=new Wb.File(true,\"wb/system/config.json\").object;Wb.each(b,((c,l)=>{if(c.startsWith(t)){a=c.substr(n);if(!a.includes(\".\")){l=b[c];s=l.value;i=l.type;if(i==\"object\"||i==\"array\")s=Wb.encode(s);e.push({name:a,value:s,type:i,list:Wb.encode(l.list),desc:l?.[Str.lang]??l?.text})}}}));e.mixSort(\"name\");Wb.send(e)}main();"},"_icon":"module"}